    <detaileddescription>
<para>Parses a list of values.</para><para>Parses a list of values separated by specified regular expressions. Each member of the list may have its own parser and following separator. The final parser and separator are reused as often as necessary. The return value is a <ref refid="classSawyer_1_1CommandLine_1_1ParsedValue" kindref="compound">ParsedValue</ref> whose value is an STL <computeroutput>list</computeroutput> with members that are the <ref refid="classSawyer_1_1CommandLine_1_1ParsedValue" kindref="compound">ParsedValue</ref> objects return by the list element parsers.</para><para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="group__sawyer__parser__factories" kindref="compound">Command line parser factories</ref> </para></simplesect>
</para>    </detaileddescription>
